Each hypothesis is one fact of the given field, written as 'Field: value' in text, with the bare value in value. For a missing or unverifiable target, text names the fact a reader would look for (for example 'Date: dispatch date of the parcel') and value is null.

{
  "documents": [
    {
      "title": "Illustration brief",
      "text": "Buyer: Nara Velin\nSeller: Suri Kelana, Indonesia\nProject: The Lantern Mouse\n\nPlease create six full-color illustrations for my children's book, The Lantern Mouse. Each illustration should fit a square page and leave clear space for the story text. The scenes follow a small mouse carrying a lantern through a rainy garden.\n\nDeliver the final artwork as six separate high-resolution PNG files. I will supply the written story and scene notes; lettering and book layout are outside this commission. Please send a sketch of each scene for my comments before coloring. One round of sketch revisions is included. We agreed on a total fee of JPY 48,000."
    },
    {
      "title": "Buyer-seller chat",
      "text": "4 March 2025, 09:10 — Nara: I've sent the six scene notes. Please keep the mouse's yellow coat consistent throughout.\n4 March 2025, 09:18 — Suri: Got them. I'll send the sketches together so you can check the sequence.\n4 March 2025, 09:24 — Nara: That works. Can you deliver the final PNGs by 28 March 2025?\n4 March 2025, 09:31 — Suri: Yes, I'll deliver them by then, provided I receive your sketch comments promptly.\n4 March 2025, 09:36 — Nara: I'll return comments within two days. Please invoice me for the agreed fee through PayPal.\n4 March 2025, 09:42 — Suri: I will send the invoice today."
    },
    {
      "title": "Illustration invoice",
      "text": "Invoice date: 4 March 2025\nFrom: Suri Kelana, Indonesia\nTo: Nara Velin\nProject: The Lantern Mouse\n\nSix full-color children's book illustrations, supplied as separate high-resolution PNG files: JPY 48,000\nOne round of sketch revisions: included\nLettering and book layout: not included\n\nTotal due: JPY 48,000\nPayment method: PayPal\nDue date: 7 March 2025\n\nThe fee covers the illustration service described in the brief. Final files are scheduled for delivery by 28 March 2025, subject to timely feedback on sketches. Please contact me if the project description needs correcting before payment."
    }
  ],
  "hypotheses": [
    {
      "text": "Amount: JPY 48,000",
      "value": "JPY 48,000"
    },
    {
      "text": "Deliverable: six separate high-resolution PNG files",
      "value": "six separate high-resolution PNG files"
    },
    {
      "text": "Date: 28 March 2025",
      "value": "28 March 2025"
    },
    {
      "text": "Party: Suri Kelana",
      "value": "Suri Kelana"
    },
    {
      "text": "Party: publisher of The Lantern Mouse",
      "value": null
    }
  ]
}
